; Load a bundle that came in, or from a stick.
FORM BUNDLE_LOAD
TITLE Load a startup bundle
SUMMARY Loads a bundle into your book, channels, schedules and forms. It never changes a card, key or keymaster.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 62
ACTION bundle_load
FIELD id Bundle received(@msg_bundles)
FIELD file Or from a file(X) check=path
FIELD accept Load it though you haven't checked the signer(Y,N) default=N
NEXT KEYMASTER
BEGIN_HELP
Bundle received:
Bundles that came in over the air. All its parts are gathered.
END

Load it though you haven't checked the signer:
The box first asks. Say Y only if you know where it came from. A bundle from a signer you haven't checked never changes a frequency you already hold, and brings no forms.
END
